<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<section class="wrap medium page-pad prose">
  <p class="eyebrow">House rules</p>
  <h1 class="display">Community guidelines</h1>
  <%- include('_draft') %>
  <p class="lead">FilmHouse is a place to make films together. Treat everyone the way you'd want your crew to treat you on a long night shoot.</p>
  <h2>Recommendations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Write about the craft, not the person. Be specific: a shot, a cut, a sound cue, and why it worked.</li>
    <li>Honest critique is welcome; contempt isn't. If something didn't work, say what you'd try instead.</li>
    <li>Don't recommend your own work or trade recommendations.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Credits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Credit people for what they actually did. Don't add yourself to films you didn't work on.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Bulletin board</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Be clear about dates, location and pay — including "unpaid" or "credit only".</li>
    <li>No scams, pyramid schemes, or requests for money or ID documents.</li>
    <li>No casting calls that ask for explicit material.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Not allowed anywhere</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Harassment, hate speech, threats or sharing someone's private information.</li>
    <li>Spam, fake accounts, or posting other people's work as your own.</li>
    <li>Sexual content involving anyone under 18 — reported to the authorities.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>If something's wrong</h2>
  <p>Use the <strong>Report</strong> link on any profile, film, recommendation, bulletin or photo. You can also <strong>block</strong> someone from their profile so you no longer see their posts and they can't recommend your films. Moderators aim to review reports within 24 hours.</p>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
